Section: misc
Priority: optional
Standards-Version: 4.1.4

Package: libicu74
Version: 74
Provides: libicu74
Architecture: all
Description: Dummy libicu74 package to satisfy Powershell dependency on Debian 13 (libicu76)
 This is a dummy package that provides no files.  It exists only to satisfy
 the Powershell package dependency on libicu74, allowing installation on
 Debian 13 which uses libicu76.  See
 https://github.com/PowerShell/PowerShell/issues/25865 for more information.
